        "tag": "section",
        "attrs": { "class": "section", "id": "faq" },
        "children": [
          {
            "tag": "div",
            "attrs": { "class": "wrap narrow" },
            "children": [
              { "tag": "h2", "attrs": { "class": "reveal" }, "children": ["Questions"] },
              {
                "tag": "div",
                "attrs": { "class": "faq reveal" },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": { "open": null },
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Is it safe?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "Yes. Dibsly never asks for your bank password and can’t move money. ",
                          {
                            "tag": "a",
                            "attrs": { "href": "privacy.html" },
                            "children": ["Your records stay"]
                          },
                          " on your iPhone and in your own encrypted backups; they go to Dibsly’s server only with sync (Premium), and to the AI only what a feature needs, and only with your permission."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["How much is it?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "The basics are free. Premium is $2.99 a month or $29.99 a year."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Which banks?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "monobank directly, PrivatBank, UKRSIBBANK, KredoBank and monobank statements (FOP too) and Apple Pay from any card, all free. Any other bank’s statement is read by the AI: 3 in all free, up to 25 a month with Premium."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["What does the AI see?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "Only with your permission, and only through Dibsly’s server to OpenAI. The chat: your question and the figures the answer needs. Categories in one tap: merchant names and your category names, no amounts. A receipt: its photo. Voice: a phrase your phone could not read, with your account and category names. A bank push: its text, without full card and phone numbers. Another bank’s statement: the whole file with its header — your name, address, tax number and full account numbers if the bank prints them. The files of monobank, PrivatBank, UKRSIBBANK and KredoBank statements never reach the AI."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Do I need to sign up?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "It’s optional. But with an account you can keep your money on the website too, sync it between devices, ask ChatGPT or Claude about it and share accounts."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Android?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "Not yet: iPhone, and my.dibslyapp.com in any browser (with Premium). iPad and Mac are next, then Android."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      { "tag": "summary", "attrs": {}, "children": ["How do I cancel Premium?"] },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "iOS Settings → your name → Subscriptions → Dibsly, at least 24 hours before the paid period ends. Apple handles payments and refunds. When Premium ends nothing is deleted: your data stays; sync, the website and the assistants stop, and the limits go back to Free."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tag": "summary",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": ["A new iPhone: how do I move my data?"]
                      },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "Install Dibsly and choose “Restore my data” with your newest backup, or sign in to your Dibsly account (sync comes with Premium)."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "details",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tag": "summary",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": ["How do I delete my data or my account?"]
                      },
                      {
                        "tag": "p",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          "Without an account: Settings → Data health → “Delete all data” erases the data on this iPhone (an encrypted safety copy stays in the app until you delete the app). With an account: Profile (the circle next to the gear) → “Delete account and all data”, then sign in again to confirm — the server erases the account and your records, and the data disappears from your devices too; what you added to a shared account stays with its other members. “Remove from this iPhone” only erases this phone and keeps the account. Backups in iCloud Drive or Google Drive don’t go by themselves — delete them in “Backup & recovery”. Deleting doesn’t cancel Premium: cancel it in iOS Settings. What remains after deletion is in the privacy policy."
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
